{"parentUuid":"79b9143c-722e-43c9-b6f9-e2dae3ba1e77","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"cc1f7b5e-e7a1-4186-a2ff-8639171ce301","agentId":"a829a4fdfc5c3b359","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SRXTr4XFmQCXzgLRD3yQm1","type":"tool_result","content":"=== axis_version_lock CMake ===\n./tools/CMakeLists.txt\n./tools/axis_version_lock/CMakeLists.txt\n--- tool CMakeLists ---\n# PAKET W3-C (Ledger Sec.32-F4/GN-8/O-4) - axis_version_lock: eigenstaendiges C++23-Executable, das den\n# Content-Digest der Heuristik-Strategie-Header gegen tools/axis_version_lock/axis_version.lock prueft\n# (--check) bzw. das Lock neu schreibt (--write). Wiederverwendung der vorhandenen consteval-SHA-256\n# (libs/cache_engine/src/sha256/ctsha.hpp). KEINE Fremdbibliothek, kein Python.\n#\n# EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL (INERT-by-default, Anti-Phantom): der Standard-Build baut das Tool NICHT mit; es wird\n# explizit per Target gebaut (analog axis_registry_gen / gen_golden_fullpilot). Der CI-Job (W3-A) baut das\n# Target und ruft --check. golden/TABU bleiben unberuehrt (das Tool liest nur Header, schreibt nur das Lock).\n\nadd_executable(comdare_axis_version_lock EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL axis_version_lock.cpp)\ntarget_compile_features(comdare_axis_version_lock PRIVATE cxx_std_23)\ntarget_include_directories(comdare_axis_version_lock PRIVATE\n    \"${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR}/libs/cache_engine/src\")   # <sha256/ctsha.hpp>\nif(COMMAND comdare_set_platform_defines)\n    comdare_set_platform_defines(comdare_axis_version_lock)\nendif()\n=== how tools/ is added ===\n682:add_subdirectory(tools)                   # Phase C (ycsb_cli, 2026-05-13)\ntools/CMakeLists.txt:23:# PAKET W3-C (Ledger Sec.32-F4/GN-8/O-4): axis_version_lock -- Content-Digest-Tripwire der Heuristik-\ntools/CMakeLists.txt:25:add_subdirectory(axis_version_lock)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"99e2871f-1afe-4351-81c7-f9cf1cd2761b","timestamp":"2026-08-06T15:45:39.001Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== axis_version_lock CMake ===\n./tools/CMakeLists.txt\n./tools/axis_version_lock/CMakeLists.txt\n--- tool CMakeLists ---\n# PAKET W3-C (Ledger Sec.32-F4/GN-8/O-4) - axis_version_lock: eigenstaendiges C++23-Executable, das den\n# Content-Digest der Heuristik-Strategie-Header gegen tools/axis_version_lock/axis_version.lock prueft\n# (--check) bzw. das Lock neu schreibt (--write). Wiederverwendung der vorhandenen consteval-SHA-256\n# (libs/cache_engine/src/sha256/ctsha.hpp). KEINE Fremdbibliothek, kein Python.\n#\n# EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL (INERT-by-default, Anti-Phantom): der Standard-Build baut das Tool NICHT mit; es wird\n# explizit per Target gebaut (analog axis_registry_gen / gen_golden_fullpilot). Der CI-Job (W3-A) baut das\n# Target und ruft --check. golden/TABU bleiben unberuehrt (das Tool liest nur Header, schreibt nur das Lock).\n\nadd_executable(comdare_axis_version_lock EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL axis_version_lock.cpp)\ntarget_compile_features(comdare_axis_version_lock PRIVATE cxx_std_23)\ntarget_include_directories(comdare_axis_version_lock PRIVATE\n    \"${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR}/libs/cache_engine/src\")   # <sha256/ctsha.hpp>\nif(COMMAND comdare_set_platform_defines)\n    comdare_set_platform_defines(comdare_axis_version_lock)\nendif()\n=== how tools/ is added ===\n682:add_subdirectory(tools)                   # Phase C (ycsb_cli, 2026-05-13)\ntools/CMakeLists.txt:23:# PAKET W3-C (Ledger Sec.32-F4/GN-8/O-4): axis_version_lock -- Content-Digest-Tripwire der Heuristik-\ntools/CMakeLists.txt:25:add_subdirectory(axis_version_lock)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"79b9143c-722e-43c9-b6f9-e2dae3ba1e77","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/comdare/Projekte/Research/probst-diplomarbeit-cache-engine","sessionId":"5a19728e-f6e1-4736-a246-e3fda9ac35a1","version":"2.1.223","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"clever-dazzling-karp"}
